    "Coverage: no search reached 24 hours. LinkedIn ended each result list early (2-20h back), and later in the run stopped lists after a handful of posts even after reloads and real scrolling, which looks like rate limiting. Best covered: 'hiring SEO manager remote' (20h). The last 4-12 hours of the day are only partly covered.",
