    "Idea: run the searches early in the day and spaced out (a few minutes apart) to avoid the throttling; splitting into more narrow searches made the throttling worse today.",
    "Post links come from each post's activity id in the page data (no clipboard). 40 cards (group posts and some company posts) had no activity id; the one kept (Remote Talent LATAM) was matched to its ugcPost id and opened to confirm.",
    "Of 215 posts seen across searches, 171 were hiring-related; the rest were SEO/GEO chatter, ads and articles (not listed). The skipped list merges duplicate reposts.",
